  {
    "id": "equation-54",
    "section": "29. Generalized Advantage Estimation",
    "latex": "\\hat A_t^{GAE(\\gamma,\\lambda)}=\\sum_{l=0}^{\\infty}(\\gamma\\lambda)^{l}\\delta_{t+l}."
